{
  "headline": "Esomeprazole sodium is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 16.4 days on hand for the 20 mg/5 mL presentation and Corvale General has 25.5 days on hand for the same presentation",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show esomeprazole sodium is not listed on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 132 vials of the 20 mg/5 mL presentation with 8.1 vials used per day, providing 16.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 242 vials of the 20 mg/5 mL presentation with 9.5 vials used per day, providing 25.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "For the 40 mg/5 mL presentation, Corvale East has 311 vials at 9.5 per day (32.7 days) and Corvale General has 308 vials at 9.8 per day (31.5 days).",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Eugia US LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Two registered plants appear on current labels: Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) with a VAI inspection ending 2024-07-25, and Hainan Poly Pharm. Co., Ltd. (FEI 3005115952) with a VAI inspection ending 2023-06-30.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E16", "E10", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether the Eugia US LLC product can be traced to a registered plant with an acceptable inspection history before committing to purchase.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E11", "E16"]
    }
  ]
}
